# The protocol schema is machine-generated (scripts/export-protocol-schema.mjs)
# and always emits LF. With core.autocrlf=true, a fresh Windows clone would
# otherwise check this file out with CRLF, which permanently disagrees with
# the generator's LF output and fails the CI-wired `npm run proto:check` on
# an unmodified checkout. Scoped narrowly to docs/protocol rather than
# `*.json` repo-wide so it can't surprise unrelated JSON files (config,
# fixtures, etc.) that don't share this generated-and-diffed contract.
docs/protocol/*.json text eol=lf
